:18.990" end="00:19.290">ask </span><span begin="00:19.290" end="00:19.410">they </span><span begin="00:19.410" end="00:20.070">bluffin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.220" end="00:21.450"><span begin="00:20.220" end="00:20.430">I </span><span begin="00:20.430" end="00:20.940">keep </span><span begin="00:20.940" end="00:21.450">wondering</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.450" end="00:23.490"><span begin="00:21.450" end="00:21.750">Keep </span><span begin="00:21.750" end="00:21.900">you </span><span begin="00:21.900" end="00:22.380">hunting </span><span begin="00:22.380" end="00:22.680">for </span><span begin="00:22.680" end="00:22.920">my </span><span begin="00:22.920" end="00:23.490">lovin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.610" end="00:25.140"><span begin="00:23.610" end="00:23.790">But </span><span begin="00:23.790" end="00:23.880">I </span><span begin="00:23.880" end="00:24.240">crave </span><span begin="00:24.240" end="00:24.450">us </span><span begin="00:24.450" end="00:25.140">hugging</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.590" end="00:26.970"><span begin="00:25.590" end="00:25.890">You </span><span begin="00:25.890" end="00:26.130">ask </span><span begin="00:26.130" end="00:26.280">stay </span><span begin="00:26.280" end="00:26.970">stubborn</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.000" end="00:30.150"><span begin="00:27.000" end="00:27.690">Cause </span><span begin="00:27.690" end="00:27.780">I </span><span begin="00:27.780" end="00:28.170">can't </span><span begin="00:28.170" end="00:28.590">admit </span><span begin="00:28.590" end="00:28.830">that </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:29.070">you </span><span begin="00:29.070" end="00:29.370">got </span><span begin="00:29.370" end="00:29.550">all </span><span begin="00:29.550" end="00:29.700">the </span><span begin="00:29.700" end="00:30.150">strings</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.150" end="00:31.950"><span begin="00:30.150" end="00:30.270">And </span><span begin="00:30.